#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:76
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"docutils\"/> (required to build the documentation), <xref "
"linkend=\"git\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gpgme\"/> (with Python bindings), <xref "
